  "checked": "Captains and tournaments: Wright, Robson, Beckham, Gerrard and Rooney never led England out in a tournament semi (Wikipedia captains list, englandfootballonline; Robson was injured before the 1990 semi). Semis as captain: Moore 1966 WC and Euro 1968; Adams Euro 96; Kane 2018 WC, Euro 2020, Euro 2024, 2026 WC. Euro 96 semi: Shearer header from a corner in the 3rd minute, Kuntz equalised, 1-1 after extra time, Southgate's penalty saved, Germany won 6-5 (UEFA, FourFourTwo, 90min). 1966 final: Moore's long pass, Hurst left foot into the top corner, 4-2 after extra time (ESPN, Sports Mole, Wikipedia). Kane finals: Euro 2020 lost to Italy on penalties, Euro 2024 lost 2-1 to Spain in Berlin (Wikipedia both finals). 2026 WC semi lost 2-1 to Argentina (Sporting Life, theScore). Moore 4th in 1966 and 2nd in 1970 behind Gerd Müller, Riva 3rd (ballondor.com data). Kane won the 2026 Ballon d'Or in October, first Englishman since Owen in 2001 (Radio X, Fanatik, ballondor.com data for 2001). No 'you' anywhere.",
